invariant: INV-5
file: pem_files.c
catches: pem_files_test
reason: the chain call stops at the caller's entries alone, so a file of
  256 certificates under 300 entries reads, and its count, cut to
  ch_identity's uint8_t, is 0. test_chain_counts reads 255 certificates
  and requires CH_EINVAL for 256.

--- old
        if (next != PEM_BLOCKS_READ || count == chain_max || count == UINT8_MAX ||
--- new
        if (next != PEM_BLOCKS_READ || count == chain_max ||
